READ THIS AGREEMENT. IT LIMITS WARRANTIES, LIMITS OUR LIABILITY, REQUIRES YOU TO COVER CERTAIN CLAIMS AGAINST US, AND SENDS MOST DISPUTES TO INDIVIDUAL ARBITRATION UNLESS YOU OPT OUT IN TIME. IT ALSO SAYS THAT YOU, NOT DELEXOO, ARE RESPONSIBLE FOR HOW YOU USE SCREEN CAPTURE, OCR, AND AI ANALYSIS RESULTS.

If you do not agree, do not download, install, buy, or use the Software. If you already installed it, stop using it and uninstall it.

A short reading aid appears first. The numbered sections are the contract. If the reading aid and a numbered section differ, the numbered section controls.


READING AID

- An active paid subscription unlocks Securely on the computers you activate with the Stripe email you used at checkout.
- Securely is a threat-monitoring overlay. It is not antivirus, not a guarantee that every scam will be caught, and not legal advice.
- The Software is provided as is. We do not promise that OCR or AI analysis is complete, correct, or uninterrupted.
- Our liability for a claim about a subscription is limited to the amount you paid for Securely in the three months before the claim, except where the law does not allow that limit.
- You are responsible for what appears on your screen, for consent when monitoring continuously, and for rules set by schools, employers, and other services.
- Most disputes go to individual arbitration, not a class action, unless you opt out within 30 days or a mandatory consumer law says otherwise.


