5.1 If you comply with this Agreement and maintain an active paid subscription (or a promotional period Delexoo honors), Delexoo grants you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable, revocable license to install and run the object code of the Software on Computers you activate for your own use, for as long as this Agreement and the subscription allow.

