5.3 This license does not include the right to offer Securely as a service to others, to rent or lease it, to use it as the engine of a product you sell, or to present yourself as the publisher of Securely.

5.4 Any right not granted in this section requires a separate written license from Delexoo. Ask at support@trysecurely.com.


