6.1 Checkout is handled by Stripe. After payment, you activate Securely in the app with the same email used at Stripe checkout. The app checks subscription status through Securely servers.

6.2 You will not bypass, patch, or share around that check. You will not publish a method whose purpose is to unlock Securely without an active paid subscription. Circumventing a technical measure that controls access to a paid feature can violate the Digital Millennium Copyright Act, 17 U.S.C. section 1201, and similar laws, except for a reverse-engineering right that a statute gives you and that cannot be waived.

