12.1 Securely may capture screen images and OCR text from the primary monitor when you run a scan or enable monitoring. Tray and toast regions may be masked. The Securely window is hidden during capture when possible.

12.2 Do not use Securely to capture or send content you are not allowed to process. You are responsible for sensitive data that appears on screen during a scan.

12.3 The privacy policy on the Website describes how Website and billing data are handled. Local audit logs stay on your Computer unless you choose to share them.


